{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyperstacks is a world of handcrafted challenges, memorable characters, and community-made levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the residents of Hyperstacks and play handcrafted levels built around <strong>combat, parkour, and logic-driven puzzles</strong>. Take on character-led quests and jump into a growing library of community creations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY LOOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through campaign levels shaped by a cast of distinct characters, each bringing their own personality and style of challenge. Between campaign levels, return to the lobby to interact with them, take on small quests, and unlock new mechanics before diving back into the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move between campaign and community levels, you will fight, climb, dodge, solve, and adapt through all kinds of situations. Most Hyperstacks levels are built around three core pillars:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>Fight with a variety of weapons built to feel great in VR. Face melee and ranged enemies through bullet-hell encounters, react under pressure,  use the environment, hazards, and even your own fists to turn fights in your favor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/9f0c2d0b776cdfcf50ed81b753c47de3.poster.avif?t=1775857524\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/9f0c2d0b776cdfcf50ed81b753c47de3.webm?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/9f0c2d0b776cdfcf50ed81b753c47de3.mp4?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour</strong><br>Climb, zip, swing, swim, jump, and improvise your way through levels with grappling hooks, ziplines, jump platforms, teleporters, skating, hot lava, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/88faf3111c6f77cb50362edce1cf6b73.poster.avif?t=1775857524\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/88faf3111c6f77cb50362edce1cf6b73.webm?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/88faf3111c6f77cb50362edce1cf6b73.mp4?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic</strong><br>Powered by <i>Greenlink</i>, a flexible system for connecting and driving interactions, Hyperstacks supports everything from simple puzzle setups to much more elaborate contraptions, letting levels react and behave in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/1575b902c42f48fd7d76e410333476d5.poster.avif?t=1775857524\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/1575b902c42f48fd7d76e410333476d5.webm?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/1575b902c42f48fd7d76e410333476d5.mp4?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can push these systems in unexpected directions, but these three pillars shape how Hyperstacks is designed and how its levels are introduced to you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LEVEL EDITOR IS AT THE CORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every campaign level is built with the same tools available to players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperstacks includes an in-game level editor built around a flexible grid-based system, allowing players to create levels with enemies, traps, movement mechanics, puzzles, logic systems, and complex contraptions, while also customizing colors and lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.poster.avif?t=1775857524\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.webm?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.mp4?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Hyperstacks now!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1046760?t=1775857524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/296fd78a0b9e30ce0b8a866a0f79386394406d8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775857524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/770ea64d0bb8a8510ce4cb4330a4076080054ce6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775857524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/770ea64d0bb8a8510ce4cb4330a4076080054ce6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775857524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom 