75857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can push these systems in unexpected directions, but these three pillars shape how Hyperstacks is designed and how its levels are introduced to you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LEVEL EDITOR IS AT THE CORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every campaign level is built with the same tools available to players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyperstacks includes an in-game level editor built around a flexible grid-based system, allowing players to create levels with enemies, traps, movement mechanics, puzzles, logic systems, and complex contraptions, while also customizing colors and lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.poster.avif?t=1775857524\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.webm?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/extras/8cc7f7d8aab7e31e8734cbddee5be7b5.mp4?t=1775857524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Hyperstacks now!</strong></h2>","developers":["Squirrel Bytes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046760/d1bae447708fcfe1c26a92fbe9a0cc5cf4472132/header.jpg?t=1775857524","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile